SUMMARY:Hackathon prep (Front end)
DESCRIPTION:Part 1 of the three-part hackathon series workshops. Getting re
 ady for  Hacksheffield11? Join our Frontend Development Workshop to learn 
 how to build user-friendly interfaces and bring your team's ideas to life.
  We’ll cover HTML\, CSS\, and JavaScript fundamentals\, explore popular 
 frontend frameworks and libraries\, and show you how to connect your inter
 face to APIs. You’ll also discover design tools like Figma and learn abo
 ut responsive design\, accessibility\, and effective team collaboration. G
 ain practical knowledge to help you build and present a polished web appli
 cation at your hackathon! Prior web development knowledge is helpful to ha
 ve but not essential to attend.\n\nhttps://shefcompsoc.uk/events/hackathon
 -prep-front-end
LOCATION:TBC
URL:https://shefcompsoc.uk/events/hackathon-prep-front-end
SEQUENCE:215266200
CATEGORIES:TECH
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3d18a4ec2ff0807dbe0aecbed5fc2ffd@shefcompsoc.org
DTSTAMP:20261027T121000Z
DTSTART:20261119T153000Z
DTEND:20261119T170000Z
SUMMARY:Hackathon prep (Backend)
DESCRIPTION:Part 2 of the hackathon series workshops. Join our Backend Deve
 lopment Workshop to learn how to power your team's ideas behind the scenes
 . Explore how servers\, databases\, and APIs work together to build functi
 onal applications. We’ll cover backend fundamentals\, handling requests 
 and responses\, connecting to databases\, and integrating your backend wit
 h a frontend. Whether you're new to backend development or looking to stre
 ngthen your skills\, this workshop will help you build reliable\, function
 al applications and prepare for your next hackathon!\n\nhttps://shefcompso
 c.uk/events/hackathon-prep-backend
LOCATION:TBC
URL:https://shefcompsoc.uk/events/hackathon-prep-backend
SEQUENCE:215266200
CATEGORIES:TECH
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3c78a4ec2ff080848b99f8a208e6d9ff@shefcompsoc.org
DTSTAMP:20261027T121000Z
DTSTART:20261126T153000Z
DTEND:20261126T170000Z
SUMMARY:Hackathon Prep (Github/AI/Devpost)
DESCRIPTION:The final part of the hackathon workshop series. This session f
 ocuses on how AI tools can accelerate your development process\, from brai
 nstorming ideas to writing and debugging code. Learn how to set up GitHub 
 to manage your code\, collaborate with teammates\, and track changes throu
 ghout your project. We’ll also introduce Devpost\, showing you how to do
 cument your project and prepare a compelling submission. Feel free to ask 
 any questions you might have about Hacksheffield11.\n\nhttps://shefcompsoc
 .uk/events/hackathon-prep-github-ai-devpost
LOCATION:TBC
URL:https://shefcompsoc.uk/events/hackathon-prep-github-ai-devpost
SEQUENCE:215266200
CATEGORIES:TECH
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
